OL,3,GNEWSAStaff 'worked hard' to reopen
OL,4,Aleisure centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeisure centre and government staff
OL,7,Fworked hard to get the centre back open
OL,8,Fafter the detection of Legionella
OL,9,Fbacteria, a senior official says.
OL,11,FBeau Sejour Leisure Centre was closed
OL,12,Fon 15 September after routine testing
OL,13,Ffound the bacteria, which can
OL,14,Foccasionally cause Legionnaires'
OL,15,Fdisease.
OL,17,FThe centre reopened on Monday after the
OL,18,Fwater system had been "thoroughly
OL,19,Fdisinfected". As an additional
OL,20,Fprecaution, filters have now also been
OL,21,Finstalled across the site.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
