OL,3,GNEWSAStaff 'worked hard' to reopen
OL,4,Aleisure centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FMark Ogier, director of estates for the
OL,7,FStates of Guernsey, praised the work of
OL,8,Fteams who worked "really hard" to allow
OL,9,Fusers to return.
